{"case_id": "qa-001", "task": "qa", "task_mode": "learn", "query": "Cache 的作用是什么？", "subject": "co", "gold": {"expected_kp": ["co.storage"], "reference": "Cache 位于 CPU 与主存之间，存放近期使用的程序与数据，缓解 CPU 与主存速度不匹配。", "gold_source_ref": {"reference": "evals/results/task_eval/GOLD_REVIEW_38DRAFT_20261015_reviewed.md#qa-001；owner 人工审定（教材口径）"}, "gold_answer_status": {"reference": "present"}}, "gold_status": "reviewed", "needs_review": ["gold.gold_points"], "notes": "gold_points 需人工从 reference 提炼；expected_kp 已由名字映射为考点 ID；2026-10-15 owner 审核 pass（内容层：reference 对照教材口径审定，见 GOLD_REVIEW_38DRAFT_20261015_reviewed.md §五 QA 表）"}
{"case_id": "qa-002", "task": "qa", "task_mode": "learn", "query": "什么是二叉搜索树？", "subject": "ds", "gold": {"expected_kp": ["ds.tree"], "reference": "二叉搜索树是每个节点左子树键值均小于该节点、右子树键值均大于该节点的二叉树，支持有序查找与插入删除。", "gold_source_ref": {"reference": "evals/results/task_eval/GOLD_REVIEW_38DRAFT_20261015_reviewed.md#qa-002；owner 人工审定（教材口径）"}, "gold_answer_status": {"reference": "present"}}, "gold_status": "reviewed", "needs_review": ["gold.gold_points"], "notes": "gold_points 需人工从 reference 提炼；expected_kp 已由名字映射为考点 ID；2026-10-15 owner 审核 pass（内容层：reference 对照教材口径审定，见 GOLD_REVIEW_38DRAFT_20261015_reviewed.md §五 QA 表）"}
{"case_id": "qa-003", "task": "qa", "task_mode": "learn", "query": "TCP 三次握手的作用是什么？", "subject": "network", "gold": {"expected_kp": ["cn.transport"], "reference": "三次握手用于同步双方初始序号、确认收发能力并协商 MSS 等参数，避免历史连接造成的混乱。", "gold_source_ref": {"reference": "evals/results/task_eval/GOLD_REVIEW_38DRAFT_20261015_reviewed.md#qa-003；owner 人工审定（教材口径）"}, "gold_answer_status": {"reference": "present"}}, "gold_status": "reviewed", "needs_review": ["gold.gold_points"], "notes": "gold_points 需人工从 reference 提炼；expected_kp 已由名字映射为考点 ID；2026-10-15 owner 审核 pass（内容层：reference 对照教材口径审定，见 GOLD_REVIEW_38DRAFT_20261015_reviewed.md §五 QA 表）"}
{"case_id": "qa-004", "task": "qa", "task_mode": "learn", "query": "什么是进程死锁？死锁的四个必要条件是什么？", "subject": "os", "gold": {"expected_kp": ["os.process"], "reference": "死锁是多个进程互相等待对方持有的资源而都无法继续执行的状态。四个必要条件：互斥、占有并等待、不可抢占、循环等待。", "gold_source_ref": {"reference": "evals/results/task_eval/GOLD_REVIEW_38DRAFT_20261015_reviewed.md#qa-004；owner 人工审定（教材口径）"}, "gold_answer_status": {"reference": "present"}}, "gold_status": "reviewed", "needs_review": ["gold.gold_points"], "notes": "gold_points 需人工从 reference 提炼；expected_kp 已由名字映射为考点 ID；2026-10-15 owner 审核 pass（内容层：reference 对照教材口径审定，见 GOLD_REVIEW_38DRAFT_20261015_reviewed.md §五 QA 表）"}
{"case_id": "qa-005", "task": "qa", "task_mode": "learn", "query": "什么是存储器层次结构？", "subject": "co", "gold": {"expected_kp": ["co.storage"], "reference": "典型层次为寄存器-Cache-主存-辅存；Cache-主存解决速度问题，主存-辅存解决容量问题。", "gold_source_ref": {"reference": "evals/results/task_eval/GOLD_REVIEW_38DRAFT_20261015_reviewed.md#qa-005；owner 人工审定（教材口径）"}, "gold_answer_status": {"reference": "present"}}, "gold_status": "reviewed", "needs_review": ["gold.gold_points"], "notes": "gold_points 需人工从 reference 提炼；expected_kp 已由名字映射为考点 ID；2026-10-15 owner 审核 pass（内容层：reference 对照教材口径审定，见 GOLD_REVIEW_38DRAFT_20261015_reviewed.md §五 QA 表）"}
{"case_id": "qa-006", "task": "qa", "task_mode": "learn", "query": "栈和队列的主要区别是什么？", "subject": "ds", "gold": {"expected_kp": ["ds.stack_queue"], "reference": "栈是后进先出（LIFO），队列是先进先出（FIFO）；栈只能在栈顶操作，队列在队尾入队、队头出队。", "gold_source_ref": {"reference": "evals/results/task_eval/GOLD_REVIEW_38DRAFT_20261015_reviewed.md#qa-006；owner 人工审定（教材口径）"}, "gold_answer_status": {"reference": "present"}}, "gold_status": "reviewed", "needs_review": ["gold.gold_points"], "notes": "gold_points 需人工从 reference 提炼；expected_kp 已由名字映射为考点 ID；2026-10-15 owner 审核 pass（内容层：reference 对照教材口径审定，见 GOLD_REVIEW_38DRAFT_20261015_reviewed.md §五 QA 表）"}
{"case_id": "qa-007", "task": "qa", "task_mode": "learn", "query": "TCP 和 UDP 的主要区别是什么？", "subject": "network", "gold": {"expected_kp": ["cn.transport"], "reference": "TCP 面向连接、可靠、有序、有流量与拥塞控制；UDP 无连接、不保证可靠，开销小、实时性好。", "gold_source_ref": {"reference": "evals/results/task_eval/GOLD_REVIEW_38DRAFT_20261015_reviewed.md#qa-007；owner 人工审定（教材口径）"}, "gold_answer_status": {"reference": "present"}}, "gold_status": "reviewed", "needs_review": ["gold.gold_points"], "notes": "gold_points 需人工从 reference 提炼；expected_kp 已由名字映射为考点 ID；2026-10-15 owner 审核 pass（内容层：reference 对照教材口径审定，见 GOLD_REVIEW_38DRAFT_20261015_reviewed.md §五 QA 表）"}
{"case_id": "qa-008", "task": "qa", "task_mode": "learn", "query": "虚拟内存的作用是什么？", "subject": "os", "gold": {"expected_kp": ["os.memory"], "reference": "虚拟内存让进程逻辑地址空间可以大于物理内存，通过分页/置换在磁盘与内存间换入换出，提高多道程序度并隔离进程地址空间。", "gold_source_ref": {"reference": "evals/results/task_eval/GOLD_REVIEW_38DRAFT_20261015_reviewed.md#qa-008；owner 人工审定（教材口径）"}, "gold_answer_status": {"reference": "present"}}, "gold_status": "reviewed", "needs_review": ["gold.gold_points"], "notes": "gold_points 需人工从 reference 提炼；expected_kp 已由名字映射为考点 ID；2026-10-15 owner 审核 pass（内容层：reference 对照教材口径审定，见 GOLD_REVIEW_38DRAFT_20261015_reviewed.md §五 QA 表）"}
{"case_id": "qa-009", "task": "qa", "task_mode": "learn", "query": "MAR 和 MDR 分别是什么？", "subject": "co", "gold": {"expected_kp": ["co.overview", "co.storage"], "reference": "MAR 是主存地址寄存器，保存访问地址；MDR 是主存数据寄存器，保存读出或待写入的数据。二者逻辑上属存储器但集成在 CPU。", "gold_source_ref": {"reference": "evals/results/task_eval/GOLD_REVIEW_38DRAFT_20261015_reviewed.md#qa-009；owner 人工审定（教材口径）"}, "gold_answer_status": {"reference": "present"}}, "gold_status": "reviewed", "needs_review": ["gold.gold_points"], "notes": "gold_points 需人工从 reference 提炼；expected_kp 已由名字映射为考点 ID；2026-10-15 owner 审核 pass（内容层：reference 对照教材口径审定，见 GOLD_REVIEW_38DRAFT_20261015_reviewed.md §五 QA 表）"}
{"case_id": "qa-010", "task": "qa", "task_mode": "learn", "query": "什么是哈希冲突？如何解决？", "subject": "ds", "gold": {"expected_kp": ["ds.search"], "reference": "哈希冲突指不同关键字映射到同一地址。解决方法包括开放定址法、链地址法（拉链法）、再哈希等。", "gold_source_ref": {"reference": "evals/results/task_eval/GOLD_REVIEW_38DRAFT_20261015_reviewed.md#qa-010；owner 人工审定（教材口径）"}, "gold_answer_status": {"reference": "present"}}, "gold_status": "reviewed", "needs_review": ["gold.gold_points"], "notes": "gold_points 需人工从 reference 提炼；expected_kp 已由名字映射为考点 ID；2026-10-15 owner 审核 pass（内容层：reference 对照教材口径审定，见 GOLD_REVIEW_38DRAFT_20261015_reviewed.md §五 QA 表）"}
{"case_id": "qa-011", "task": "qa", "task_mode": "learn", "query": "什么是拥塞控制？TCP 拥塞控制有哪些阶段？", "subject": "network", "gold": {"expected_kp": ["cn.transport"], "reference": "拥塞控制防止过多数据注入网络导致性能下降。TCP 拥塞控制包含两类机制：①拥塞窗口控制阶段——慢开始（cwnd 指数增长）与拥塞避免（cwnd 线性增长）；②丢包检测与恢复机制——快重传（收到 3 个重复 ACK 即重传丢失报文段，不等超时）与快恢复（快重传后将 cwnd 减半再线性增长，而非回到 1）。", "gold_source_ref": {"reference": "evals/results/task_eval/GOLD_REVIEW_38DRAFT_20261015_reviewed.md#qa-011；owner 人工审定（教材口径）"}, "gold_answer_status": {"reference": "present"}}, "gold_status": "reviewed", "needs_review": ["gold.gold_points"], "notes": "gold_points 需人工从 reference 提炼；expected_kp 已由名字映射为考点 ID；2026-10-15 owner 审核 needs_fix：改写 reference：慢开始/拥塞避免属拥塞窗口控制「阶段」、快重传/快恢复属丢包检测与恢复「机制」，保留可接受教材口径（gold_status 维持 draft，gold 值不动）；2026-10-15 owner 审核 needs_fix 修复：reference 改写为阶段/机制两档口径（慢开始+拥塞避免=拥塞窗口控制阶段，快重传+快恢复=丢包检测与恢复机制），owner 授权项目方按推荐方案执行；gold_status draft→reviewed，gold_source_ref/gold_answer_status 补齐同 pass 行四件套；gold 关键值未回写旧值"}
{"case_id": "qa-012", "task": "qa", "task_mode": "learn", "query": "页面置换算法中的 Belady 异常说明了什么？", "subject": "os", "gold": {"expected_kp": ["os.memory"], "reference": "Belady 异常指某些算法（如 FIFO）在物理块增加时缺页次数反而上升，说明并非所有置换算法都满足堆栈性质。", "gold_source_ref": {"reference": "evals/results/task_eval/GOLD_REVIEW_38DRAFT_20261015_reviewed.md#qa-012；owner 人工审定（教材口径）"}, "gold_answer_status": {"reference": "present"}}, "gold_status": "reviewed", "needs_review": ["gold.gold_points"], "notes": "gold_points 需人工从 reference 提炼；expected_kp 已由名字映射为考点 ID；2026-10-15 owner 审核 pass（内容层：reference 对照教材口径审定，见 GOLD_REVIEW_38DRAFT_20261015_reviewed.md §五 QA 表）"}
